	&lt;li&gt;On adding below mentioned property in `zeppelin-site.xml`, this feature should get disabled from both web-socket and REST-APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;    ```&lt;br/&gt;
    &amp;lt;property&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
      &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;zeppelin.notebook.cron.enable&amp;lt;/name&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
      &amp;lt;value&amp;gt;false&amp;lt;/value&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
      &amp;lt;description&amp;gt;Notebook enable cron scheduler feature&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
